% =====================================================================
% INSTRUCTIONS
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
% Group papers using the `category` field. The publications page is
% rendered by jekyll-scholar grouped by year (descending) automatically,
% but you can also add custom grouping via `_pages/publications.md`.
%
% Useful per-entry fields the al-folio theme supports:
%   bibtex_show={true}   -> show a "BibTeX" toggle button
%   selected={true}      -> include this paper on the front page
%   abbr={WP}            -> short tag shown next to title
%   abstract={...}       -> shown when toggling "Abs"
%   pdf={mypaper.pdf}    -> file in /assets/pdf/, or an external URL
%   html={https://...}   -> link to publisher / arXiv / SSRN page
%   preview={img.png}    -> thumbnail in /assets/img/publication_preview/
% =====================================================================

